{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14bbbe674a71de5bebd9fffbe6e661eaa2576f1fb8ead6c633533c685eeb8e86",
      "text": "咦，莫非是冬马君？那边的\n是北斗君和翔太君吧。好久不见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a355c1b7371dc035edbbdbba244b969c251f1b02a2c704ac84154ab183a1a344",
      "text": "好久不见！上次见面，\n还是我们在961 Production的时候吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b864edd1a823b8992cc49e2d638a90b83c21b3166afaa0d81940cc622f808b",
      "text": "已经过去那么久了吗。真怀念啊。\n冬马君你们还在继续当偶像，我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f37e637f09366b2d067f97f405c5a849e6ab25d5f799a86e97282952fc6b892c",
      "text": "谢谢。你们那边最近怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3caf33dd3295ca3d68100b8034bd476fe755a4f1df932a54c14f88004673f707",
      "text": "其实……最近，受到了属于大型唱片公司的乐队\n施加的压力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eef2c314e0bd0fd63ba7174e9362025c601ff2081502fae1bb89f50612fd11be",
      "text": "我们乐队一直作为据点活动的\nLivehouse用不了了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bfad9323030fd096ae859b4e2c21446ae28c3328a68a90788574722ab18e614",
      "text": "搞什么啊那是……你们乐队做的曲子，\n明明全都是超级棒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339610c10968fb9f84271a121a4807e41bac80abf05fe8f4bf54a14b3390f75d",
      "text": "演奏也棒到让人热血沸腾。\n妨碍别人什么的绝不可原谅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f70a14408d12280c9540b6beaa438f058dc44a06dbfbeb115cc776857880fa8",
      "text": "冬马君，我懂你的心情，\n但别在走廊里这么激动嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48244171917f61f6ba4141621d8b1aecb7bb671942f1a7e5efab3ded7ea117b7",
      "text": "我也听过那样的传闻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5e766a40c7bf63c98952150704a56c12f3458c193d93bc4a1511539b692572f",
      "text": "前阵子见到的天使酱刚好是你们的粉丝，\n因为去不了演出而感到很遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c254f00780af460238cc7743b83fefa866b194088172834eab466ec66df5a5",
      "text": "这样啊……果然还是让粉丝们\n伤心了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3041916f2d3c6e99d23cbb76ce94143112a6e07215484a3d0d4ae49efaeb7e",
      "text": "希望你们不要输给那些家伙。如果我们有\n能帮上忙的地方，请尽管说！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
